Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Can I smoosh your cheeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:18.97,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:22.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You are so incredibly cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:45.03,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Thank you for playing with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:45.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:49.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gotta say, she looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you like your big sister, Ayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:54.76,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:56.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Which one do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:03.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Personally, I've been a big fan \Nof your cool big sister lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:05.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hey... come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.38,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I'm going to protect Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:15.63,main,Eiji/Ayaka,0,0,0,,- So cool!\N- So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:20.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Don't make me do this around my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:24.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She says that, but your \Nsister always plays along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:26.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I seriously respect that about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:31.64,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Then do you know about \Nwhen she's being lazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.91,0:01:34.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Tell me, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.81,0:01:40.68,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,See, sometimes she doesn't \Nwant to move from the couch,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.80,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,so I have to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:47.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,O-Only when I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's pretty rare!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:51.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd love to meet Lazy-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:57.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:02.06,main,Lazy Rin,0,0,0,,Ugh... Don't wanna move...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:07.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ayaka-chan even came by to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.31,main,Lazy Rin,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.30,main,Lazy Rin,0,0,0,,Get me my tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:13.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's right there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.33,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,She won't cheer up \Nunless you do what she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.94,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:29.58,sign_3356_34_Tea,Bottle sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\move(604.777,256.555,497.221,141.888,23,616)}Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:21.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here's your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.83,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Say I'm cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.58,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want you to say I'm cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're such a cute big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:41.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what that has to \Ndo with being lazy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:45.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Plus, you're more than just cute, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:53.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She isn't changing back, huh? \NNow that's dedication to a role.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:32.00,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,479)\pos(488.778,302.556)}Episode 5       Summer Vacation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:37.96,sign_6545_42_End_of_Term__Cle,Blackboard,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs18\move(561.778,278,562.667,78.889,21,4984)}{\blur0.3}End of Term \NCeremony!\N\NTake all your \Npersonal\N belongings \Nhome!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:43.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin... you have plans for summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:49.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Quit snickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:54.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want you to call me Rin, too, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:02.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, I just can't get \Nused to using your name...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:08.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, does Spoiled-chan \Nhave any plans for summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:15.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:17.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,how about you try calling me by my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:19.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You'll wanna run for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.25,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Eiji-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:31.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Th-That completely backfired...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You just need to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Except we're heading \Ninto summer vacation, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Just give it up, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:44.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Or what, are you gonna come see me \Nduring summer vacation or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:47.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I actually have no plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wow. That's... sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:52.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We'll hang out a bunch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:55.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Uh... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:03.85,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:06.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We've totally lost the prez \Nand the others, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:30.49,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I kind of hope we don't find them, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,W-Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:36.91,sign_9487_70_Shooting_Range,Booth sign,0,0,0,,{\frz6.041\pos(483,74.333)\frx8\fry346}{\blur0.9}Shooting Range
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,See? Looks just like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:41.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wanna win it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:49.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:50.80,main,Stall Guy,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.38,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right, let's have Cool-chan try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.15,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:04.79,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm about to pop like \N48 inches of fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:12.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, enough goofing around. \NLet's find the rest of the club...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hang on, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,L-Look, they've got cotton candy over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on, cotton candy can wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I want some!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:33.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,we need to find the others \Nbefore we enjoy this any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:44.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,L-Look, masks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:46.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on, that's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:48.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nothing gets you in the \Nfestival mood more than masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:51.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're not gonna wanna \Nfind them at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You realize I'm trying \Nto hold back here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Masks! Let's check out the masks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:04.50,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the show my \Nlittle sister's really into.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm gonna buy it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.49,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Th-The president!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Senpai, put this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You can't just hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:27.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We need to go after Prism Melody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'll guide you to your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:35.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:38.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You watch Princess Rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:41.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I caught the movie when \Nit aired yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.04,main,Kid 1,0,0,0,,Let's go over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:44.58,main,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.51,0:09:09.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're your guardians today, ladies, \Nso make sure to listen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:10.44,sign_13114_108_Nanakura_s_Siste,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz5.125\c&H212D37&\move(168.112,224,169.89,305.778,23,900)}Her Friend \N{\fs14}Moe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:10.44,sign_13114_108_Nanakura_s_Siste,Signs,0,0,0,,{\c&H23303B&\fs12\frz4.99\move(483.668,178.666,482.779,258.666,23,744)}Nanakura's Sister\N{\fs14}Ayaka
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.44,main,Ayaka/Moe,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,In particular,\N listen to the big sister here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:15.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She's the most grown up one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We'll call her boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:18.24,main,Ayaka/Moe,0,0,0,,- Boss!\N- Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.66,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.39,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, you need to look after them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:30.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's taking everything I've got not to \Nbe tempted by the water slide...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:33.88,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.10,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Do the thing where you throw us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.91,0:09:39.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:42.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:44.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sorry, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:53.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm in adult mode. I won't be tempted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:59.50,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,In that case... can you \Nput some sunscreen on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, that's super adult mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:04.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on! Why are you trying to tempt me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:09.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you're gonna be that embarrassed,\N don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:13.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But... I wanna have fun, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin... I had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, the Boss has signed off on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:21.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And remember, if one of \Nus gets hurt, all of us do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.44,main,Ayaka/Moe,0,0,0,,- Yeah!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This is no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin, hide me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.15,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:47.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The kids keep making me do \Nthe butterfly stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:48.71,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.60,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Where's Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.92,main,Moe,0,0,0,,We wanted to play more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:54.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:58.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The thing is, he swam so much, \Nhe melted into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think that's his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.75,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll fix him up, so you \Ntwo go and play, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.20,main,Moe/Ayaka,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.57,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Let's go, Moe-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I am so exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:28.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai... I know this is late, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:33.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming when I \Ninvited you on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:40.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, a big brother can't say \Nno to his little sister, can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:41.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Even when it's hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:49.47,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Suddenly I'm not tired anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:57.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And I know this is coming late, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:05.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But your swimsuit is really cute, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:08.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,R-Really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure when to bring it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:15.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,that felt a bit like complimenting \Nan actual sister's swimsuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,which feels gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I might have timed it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:22.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're taking this big \Nbrother thing too seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:32.14,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\move(629.333,126.444,-550.445,126.444,29,8496)}Much {\c&H4B6465&}Ado {\c&H876ADB&}About {\c&H4B6465&}Nothing {\c&H876ADB&}Special: {\c&HBCAA63&}Lazy-chan{\c&H4B6465&} Observation{\c&H876ADB&} Log
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:30.48,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing Special: \NLazy-chan Observation Log
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.54,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.27,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4F545E&\pos(303.111,135.333)}Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.37,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Looks like she's not moving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.52,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I wonder how much more \NI can get away with...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:55.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya... dader dips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Fang goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:09.68,sign_18775_174_Chips,Bag sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(198.333,311.333)\b1}Chips
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:04.92,main - top,Ayaka,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:09.68,main - italics top,Ayaka,0,0,0,,"Dader dips" is potato chips, \Nand "fang goo" is thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:16.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya... I want nori salt flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Nori salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.89,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:28.95,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)\pos(468.666,335.112)}{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(520.556,347.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:33.95,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(101.001,118.223)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo\N {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:40.32,main,rin,0,0,0,,And so then I was in the inner tube,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:43.84,main,rin,0,0,0,,so we were this close! Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.41,0:13:47.35,main,rin,0,0,0,,And then Senpai was all like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.89,main,rin,0,0,0,,"Your swimsuit is cute, Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:02.72,main,rin,0,0,0,,Can you believe it, Megu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:06.77,main,Megu,0,0,0,,We've been over this. \NA lot. Over the phone, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:08.60,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Hey, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.60,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I don't understand this question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Whatcha got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay, want me to do it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.26,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.58,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You're spoiling her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:24.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But if Aya hadn't said she \Nwanted to go to the pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:27.30,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You'll have to ask him \Nout yourself next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.30,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:33.84,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Don't you and Senpai-san \Ngo out all the time, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:36.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Those are more like... random occurrences...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:39.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't exactly invite him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:43.56,main,Megu,0,0,0,,In that case, maybe you could \Nhave Cool-chan ask him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:44.96,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You know, that whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:50.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She says she can't do it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.60,main,Megu,0,0,0,,How's that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:55.08,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Also, that doesn't sound very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:15:00.58,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I could ask him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya-chan... Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.86,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Don't put your little sister \Nup to stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:39.18,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm visiting my grandparents right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:45.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Way out in the country... let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:48.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There aren't any stores!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And I want some ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.13,sign_3356_34_Tea,Phone button signs,0,0,0,,{\c&HF3F3F3&\frz292.8\pos(519.445,200.556)}{\blur0.4\c&HF6F6F6&}Send
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.14,sign_18775_174_Chips,Phone button signs,0,0,0,,{\fs11\pos(258.777,162)\frz20.45}Sending...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:02.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I sent it! I sent it! \NI actually sent it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.65,sign_23081_215_Mr__Prop_Departm,Eiji Screenname,0,0,0,,{\frz16.1\c&H575258&\pos(213.445,61)}Mr. Prop Department
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:06.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Huh? A video?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:08.40,sign_18775_174_Chips,Button Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\b0\frz21.43\pos(232.112,103.334)}Downloading
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:12.94,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Visiting the country sounds nice! \NI'm jealous you get to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:20.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But seriously, watch out for heatstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:23.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:27.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can send you a scary \Nvideo to give you chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.42,sign_23081_215_Mr__Prop_Departm,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H777173&\fs14\frz14.9\pos(183.222,52.999)}P-Please don't!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,P-Please don't! {also entered text}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:40.11,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Here's the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:42.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's pretty, but really hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:49.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,If I get heatstroke, it'd be nice if \Nyou came out here to take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:52.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Now! Send it before you lose your nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.50,sign_24479_228_New_message_from,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz14.38\c&H4E4F4E&\frx10\fry0\pos(281,121.777)}New message from Mr. Prop Department
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.96,sign_24623_229_I_was_so_focused,Message sign,0,0,0,,{\frz20.36\frx358\fry358\pos(173.778,231.111)}I was so focused on the \Nvideo I dropped my ice cream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:08.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oops...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.96,sign_24623_229_I_was_so_focused,Message sign,0,0,0,,{\frz19.87\pos(156,236.444)}It's hot. I wanna go swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:15.97,sign_24623_229_I_was_so_focused,Message sign,0,0,0,,{\frz20.57\pos(118.667,255.111)\frx356\fry356}I'll send a video
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:51.04,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Shiro-kun, it's been a while. \NI'm back again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.38,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:56.10,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Should I get ice cream or a ramune drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:59.38,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Ramune! That's more summery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:03.18,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Oh, they have ramune-flavored ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:07.32,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,What, you went with ice cream anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.02,main,Ayaka(Tsundere),0,0,0,,If you insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:14.77,main,Ayaka(Tsundere),0,0,0,,This one time, I'll follow your advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.96,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Wha... What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:19.97,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I was copying my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:29.26,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Okay, let's head to the \Nmountains behind Grandpa's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:31.54,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Gonna catch us some bugs! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.71,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I wanted to go to the beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:46.05,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,But I've got my net and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:52.01,main,Ayaka (Spoiled),0,0,0,,I want you to take me to the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:59.16,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.59,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Copying her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.05,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,So, how long are you gonna be in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:10.22,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Until the 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.34,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,You doing anything tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.46,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,You want to play tomorrow too, Shiro-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.45,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,N-Not exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:23.37,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I won't play with you \Nunless you ask me properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.89,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,B-Bug catching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.91,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we're going bug catching, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.62,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Look! There's a crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:49.60,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:50.47,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.87,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Nah, you can find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:57.88,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,Man, this is boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:02.56,main,Shiro,0,0,0,,And no trunks means I can't go swimming, \Nso it's super hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.18,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:58.56,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\move(629.333,126.444,-550.445,126.444,29,8496)}Much {\c&H4B6465&}Ado {\c&H876ADB&}About {\c&H4B6465&}Nothing {\c&H876ADB&}Special: {\c&HBCAA63&}Lazy-chan{\c&H4B6465&} Observation{\c&H876ADB&} Log
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:57.08,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing Special: \NLazy-chan Observation Log
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:01.65,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3A5051&\pos(298.667,144.222)}Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.66,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.40,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,You've got an important meeting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.92,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I think we'll go with this necktie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Am I playing the daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:20.16,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,No, you're the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:25.93,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,She stopped moving. \NIs it because she's a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.17,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Wanna play video games?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:40.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're pretty good, Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.68,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,When she's Lazy-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:44.98,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I can beat her in the \Ngames she usually wins at!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:27.84,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\move(629.333,126.444,-550.445,126.444,29,8496)}Much {\c&H4B6465&}Ado {\c&H876ADB&}About {\c&H4B6465&}Nothing {\c&H876ADB&}Special: {\c&HBCAA63&}Lazy-chan{\c&H4B6465&} Observation{\c&H876ADB&} Log
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:26.34,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing Special: \NLazy-chan Observation Log.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.93,sign_17830_165_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3A5051&\pos(302.222,139.778)}Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:29.99,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Part 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:37.28,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,She got yelled at for laying around \Nand making her uniform all wrinkly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:43.56,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I wonder if I raised you wrong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.75,0:23:48.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,...Where did you hear such a phrase?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:50.40,main,,0,0,0,,
